OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump signs order to rename Lake
OL,4,AOntario as Lake America
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump said the renaming of the lake,
OL,7,Fwhich straddles both countries, was
OL,8,Feffective immediately. He has broad
OL,9,Fdiscretion over how the US recognises
OL,10,Flandmarks but other countries do not
OL,11,Fhave to follow.
OL,13,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,14,Fsaid in response that "things must be
OL,15,Fcalled by their name, and this lake is
OL,16,Fcalled Lake Ontario - today and
OL,17,Fforever".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
